/* meow-ios — Turkish (tr) localization.

   Covers the tr device locale. Key set is 1:1 with en.lproj — every key in
   en.lproj/Localizable.strings appears here, in the same order, with a real
   translation. Strings deliberately omitted from en.lproj (QA/OCR harness pins,
   stable diagnostic reason codes, internal chart bindings, log-level Picker
   .tag() values) must NOT be added here either — see en.lproj header for the
   exclusion list.

   Terminology follows meow-android values-tr (mobile + core) so both apps read
   the same: "config" → "yapılandırma", "profile" → "profil", "engine" →
   "çekirdek", "Route Mode" → "Yönlendirme modu", Rule / Global / Direct →
   Kural / Global / Doğrudan, Upload / Download → Yükleme / İndirme,
   "latency" → "gecikme", "Logs" → "Günlükler". "Proxy" stays "proxy".

   Style:
     - Sentence case for titles, buttons and toggles, as in meow-android
       values-tr ("Proxy grupları", "Bu ay").
     - Never attach a Turkish suffix to a placeholder ("%@'i") — vowel harmony
       can't adapt at runtime. Use "Etiket: %@", "%@ için", "%@ üzerinden", or
       put the suffix on a fixed noun ("%@ yapılandırmasını").
     - Counts stay plural-neutral (Turkish nouns are singular after numerals).
     - Ellipsis is the single character "…" (U+2026), matching en.lproj. */


